  "is_atomic": true,
  "atomic_questions": [
    "For each product and quarter, is the \"contract reservation\" figure a minimum demand that must be delivered in that quarter (so producing less creates a backorder that incurs the delay compensation), or is it a maximum cap on how many units can be delivered in that quarter?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks for a single policy definition (minimum vs. maximum) regarding the contract reservation figure, which constitutes one semantically independent clarification question."
}

